"<p>SaaSBase offers first-class support for the entire Supabase ecosystem:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PostgreSQL with pgvector:</strong> AI embeddings and transactional data.</li>\n<li><strong>GoTrue Auth:</strong> Email/password, OAuth, and magic link authentication.</li>\n<li><strong>PostgREST:</strong> Instant RESTful APIs from database tables.</li>\n<li><strong>Realtime Server:</strong> WebSockets for change data capture.</li>\n<li><strong>Storage Engine:</strong> S3-compatible file storage with image resizing.</li>\n<li><strong>Supabase Studio:</strong> Web-based database management interface.</li>\n</ul>"